					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I originally saw that a number of -J articles do not include the -J in the body, but I don't think it loses its merit to include it. I'll add it.<br /> The lack of direct SCP-1912-J-1 reference is intentional, to keep the less literal nature of the article afloat. Though, it should be heavily implied by context.</p> 
